          \n                                    \n                                \n                                                Home\n                    </a>\n                </li>\n                                            <li>\n                                            <i></i>\n                    \n                    <a href=\"https://wamiz.co.uk/news\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                                                        News\n                    </a>\n                </li>\n                                            <li>\n                                            <i></i>\n                    \n                    <a href=\"https://wamiz.co.uk/news/news\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                                                        News\n                    </a>\n                </li>\n                                            <li>\n                                            <i></i>\n                    \n                    <a href=\"https://wamiz.co.uk/news/news/animal-welfare\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                                                        Animal welfare\n                    </a>\n                </li>\n                    </ol>\n    \n\n                    \n            \n            \n                        \n            \n                    \n\n                            \n            \n        \n    \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                <p>While shopping at a DIY and garden centre in New Jersey, USA, a lady was intrigued by a strange noise.</p>\n                    \n    \n                        \n            \n    \n                    \n    \n\n    \n\n            \n                            \n                                            <p>Listening closely, she heard tiny meows coming from high up.</p><p>Intrigued, the shopper looked up and spotted a cardboard box sitting on a pallet.</p><h2>A handwritten warning</h2><p>Written on one side of the box, it read: <i>\"Warning! Newborn kittens.\"</i> The customer rushed to alert a store manager, and the staff immediately investigated. It turned out that a team member had found the kittens on the pallet and written the message to alert their colleagues.</p><p>The employee had hoped that their mother would return to collect her babies. Sadly, however, this part of the shop is very busy and poses too many risks for such young kittens.</p><h2>In safe hands</h2><p>Fortunately, the customer was familiar with the charity Rebecca’s Rescues and contacted the shelter. Rescuers arrived and retrieved the six tiny kittens one by one, as they were tucked away between the boxes. Store employees are still searching for the mother cat.</p><p>The six kittens have now been placed in a foster home. For the time being, they are being bottle-fed and are under constant supervision. Thanks to the love and care of their foster family, they are growing well. We wish them all the very best for the future.</p>\n                                    \n            \n                                            \n    \n                    <p>\n                Translated from the FR Wamiz website using artificial intelligence\n            </p>\n            \n\n            \n                    \n\n        \n                    \n        \n\n                    <ul>\n                                    <li>\n                        <a href=\"https://wamiz.co.uk/news/202701/neighbours-leave-unique-gift-garden-11-year-old-cat-who-beat-cancer\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            Neighbours leave unique gift in garden for 11-year-old cat who beat cancer\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                                    <li>\n                        <a href=\"https://wamiz.co.uk/news/202610/thousands-viewers-watch-shocking-